        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 3029-8, 8\" Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n8\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Mortise Type - Door flange is mortised into edge of door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors 1-1/2\" to 2\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 8\" Double Acting Spring Hinges permit doors to open in either direction and automatically return to the closed position. \r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Double Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus wood mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTo find the proper size Bommer Double Acting Spring Hinge for your doors weight and width. use the charts here: <a href=\"/pages/bommer-double-acting-spring-hinge-selection\"><b>Bommer Spring Hinge Charts</b></a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bommer 3029-8 Double Acting Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" - 2\"  Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3029-8.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3029-8 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Bommer-3029-hinge-install.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 3029 Series Installation (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 3029 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Bommer 3029-8 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Bommer Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>3029-8</td>\r\n<td>103 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-6\"</td>\r\n<td>143 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-1/2\" - 2\"</td>\r\n<td>7'-0\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Do Not use on Doors with Hinge Edge Beveled.</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 3029 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. None are available.</b>\r\n</p>",
